<?php declare(strict_types=1); ?><!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="description" content="Project Unveiled presents Truth on Trial, powered by the Trust-Worthy investigation method. Question everything, inspect the evidence, and you be the judge."><title>Project Unveiled | Truth on Trial</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/truth/truth-worthy.css"></head><body><header class="topbar"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/truth/">PROJECT UNVEILED <span>TRUTH ON TRIAL</span></a><nav class="navlinks"><a href="#featured">Featured Trial</a><a href="#trials">Truth Trials</a><a href="#ask">Ask a Question</a><a href="/book/research.html">Research Standards</a></nav></div></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">PROJECT UNVEILED · TRUTH ON TRIAL · POWERED BY TRUST-WORTHY</div><h1>QUESTION EVERYTHING!</h1><p>Bring the question. We trace the evidence, test the strongest competing explanations, expose what does not add up, and separate what is proven from what is inferred or still unknown.</p><div class="manifesto"><strong>We do not tell you what to think.</strong> We show our work. <strong>You be the judge.</strong></div></div></section><section class="section" id="featured"><div class="wrap"><article class="card daily-desk"><div class="eyebrow">FEATURED TRUTH TRIAL · CASE 000004</div><h2>Did the CIA control the American media?</h2><p>The historical record proves something more serious than “nothing happened,” but less than the broadest internet version of the claim. This trial separates documented CIA-journalist relationships from the much larger claim of total media control.</p><div class="finding"><strong>Free finding:</strong> CIA relationships with journalists and covert media activity are documented. The Church Committee considered the issue serious enough to recommend restrictions, and CIA policy changed in 1976. The evidence reviewed here does not establish centralized CIA control of the entire American press—or prove that such control exists today.</div><p><a class="button" href="/truth/case-000004.php">Put the Claim on Trial</a></p></article></div></section><section class="section" id="trials"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Published & Open Investigations</div><h2>Truth Trials</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="case-head"><div><div class="case-id">PU-TOT-000003</div><h2>Who was Jesus — before religion told us who he was?</h2></div><div class="status">OPEN</div></div><p>The surviving early evidence strongly supports a historical first-century Jesus behind the Christian movement, while the supernatural claims require a separate evidentiary trial.</p><p><a class="button" href="/truth/case-000003.php">Examine Case</a></p></article><article class="card"><div class="case-head"><div><div class="case-id">TW-CLAIM-000001</div><h2>Does God individually cause or permit every bad thing?</h2></div><div class="status">PROVISIONAL</div></div><p>The evidence does not require the conclusion that every harmful event is individually caused or separately permitted by God. But the opposite absolute also outruns the evidence.</p><p><a class="button" href="/truth/case-000001.php">Read Investigation</a></p></article><article class="card"><div class="case-head"><div><div class="case-id">TW-CLAIM-000002</div><h2>Did Jesus teach the modern Romans Road / sinner's prayer?</h2></div><div class="status">OPEN</div></div><p>A familiar evangelical salvation formula goes on trial against Jesus' recorded teaching, Romans itself, conversion history, and its strongest defense.</p><p><a class="button" href="/truth/case-000002.php">Examine Case</a></p></article></div></div></section><section class="section" id="ask"><div class="wrap grid"><article class="card"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR TURN</div><h2>What do you think you know?</h2><p>Submit a question privately. Truth on Trial clarifies the actual claim, traces the source behind the source, actively seeks contrary evidence, and distinguishes proof from inference, opinion and unknowns.</p><form class="challenge" action="/truth/question-submit.php" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="opened_at" id="questionOpenedAt" value=""><div class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><label for="question">Put a claim or question on trial</label><textarea id="question" name="question" minlength="20" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Ask something you think you know..."></textarea><label for="questionEmail">Email for an update (optional)</label><input id="questionEmail" type="email" name="email" maxlength="190" autocomplete="email"><input type="hidden" name="topic" value="other"><button class="button" type="submit">Put It on Trial</button></form></article><aside class="card"><div class="eyebrow">THE TRUST-WORTHY METHOD</div><h2>No protected conclusions.</h2><ul class="rules"><li>Trace toward primary and earliest accessible evidence.</li><li>Seek the strongest credible counterevidence.</li><li>Separate independent corroboration from repetition.</li><li>Examine motive, money and power without pretending motive is proof.</li><li>Label fact, inference, uncertainty and opinion distinctly.</li><li>Revise the finding when better evidence wins.</li></ul><div class="bobinated"><div class="eyebrow">Bobinated Opinion</div><p>When useful, we give a clearly labeled reasoned opinion based on the total pattern—and show exactly why.</p></div><div class="judge">YOU BE THE JUDGE.<small>POWERED BY TRUST-WORTHY</small></div></aside></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="wrap"><strong>PROJECT UNVEILED</strong> · Truth on Trial · Powered by Trust-Worthy · <strong>YOU BE THE JUDGE.</strong></div></footer><script>document.getElementById("questionOpenedAt").value=Math.floor(Date.now()/1000);</script></body></html>